      "item_stem": "In Act II of Twin Melodies, Nabin refuses to allow Shruti to perform at the Indo-Western fusion concert, citing his rule of one performance in six months and his contempt for fusion music. Which of the following best describes Nabin's stated reason for objecting to Shruti's participation in the fusion group?",
